                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.2.3"&gt;Aspire 13.2.3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h1&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.2.3&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release focused on CLI packaging, signing, and reliability fixes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🛑 aspire stop now properly cleans up application containers on Windows (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4256960760" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16123" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16123/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16123"&gt;#16123&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔐 Fixed macOS signing, permissions, and certificate trust with improved CI verification (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4242477221" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16053" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16053/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16053"&gt;#16053&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✍️ Fixed signing for the aspire-managed bundle payload (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4270868973" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16211" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16211/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16211"&gt;#16211&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎭 Fixed Playwright CLI provenance verification for the new tag format (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4258531392" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16134" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16134/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16134"&gt;#16134&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧭 Updated service discovery environment variables (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4272294841" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16223" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16223/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16223"&gt;#16223&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🔧 Improvements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📊 Removed telemetry API data limits and refactored URL builders (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4235917940" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16023" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16023/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16023"&gt;#16023&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⏱️ Increased native build + sign timeout to 60 minutes for reliability (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4270870174" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16212" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16212/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16212"&gt;#16212&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔖 Bumped branding to 13.2.3 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4265213029" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16181" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16181/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16181"&gt;#16181&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧪 Temporarily disabled Verify CLI archive step on Windows while investigating (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4284878301" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16276" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16276/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16276"&gt;#16276&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4285583889" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/16285" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/16285/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/16285"&gt;#16285&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
